📌 Usage Instructions
​To build the UEFI bootable ISO image directly on your build host:

# 1. Make the script executable
chmod +x make_uefi_iso.sh

# 2. Build the UEFI ISO
./make_uefi_iso.sh

# 3. Flash to a USB drive (replace /dev/sdX with your USB drive name)
sudo dd if=berry-router-uefi-1.2.0-x86_64.iso of=/dev/sdX status=progress bs=4M
